  "interactions": [
    "No optional requests/storage before consent or after rejection; analytics-only loads only GA4, with one manual initial page view",
    "First/last campaign attribution survives navigation; accepted inquiry produces one opaque-ID conversion; duplicate response and honeypot-style success do not add conversions; no form values enter SDK queues",
    "Withdrawal reloads both tabs, clears attribution/accessibly scoped vendor cookies, and prevents further optional SDK loads",
    "GPC blocks advertising despite acceptance; DNT blocks both categories",
    "Advertising-only loads the four configured provider SDKs, stores no session attribution, and deduplicates lead commands across Google Ads, Meta, LinkedIn and X",
    "GTM requires both categories and suppresses every direct-provider transport",
    "A personal/unknown query key prevents optional tags from loading",
    "First-visit master palette follows system mode; saved Option 1 preference stays authoritative; no-JavaScript dark fallback uses the approved master dark palette"
  ],
